# main points into dist/ — excluding it produces "Extension entrypoint(s)
# missing", the most common bundling-related packaging failure. Re-include
# explicitly. Do NOT also add a "files" array to package.json: vsce exits 1
# on "VSCE does not support combining both strategies".
!dist/**
!media/**
!schemas/**
!skill/**
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md

# Full-resolution artwork lives in art/ and never ships. It is OUTSIDE media/
# on purpose: `!media/**` above re-includes that whole directory, and an
# exclusion listed after it did not win — the 1.6 MB source was packaged
# anyway. Keeping the source out of the re-included tree is what actually works.
art/**
